---
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
---

<div class="grid">
  <article>
    <SectionTitle tag="p">ARCHITECTURE</SectionTitle>
    <h2>
      I ARCHITECT LARGE-SCALE ENTERPRISE WEB APPLICATIONS TO SHIP ROBUST
      SOLUTIONS THAT ARE <span class="highlight-p">SAFE & MAINTAINABLE</span>.
    </h2>
    <p>
      My role includes aligning cross-functional teams — defining technology
      stacks and establishing best practices. I focus on building the backend of
      the frontend, guiding my team through complex challenges to deliver
      reliable, future-proof web applications.
    </p>
  </article>

  <article>
    <SectionTitle tag="p" signalVariant="yellow">UI ENGINEERING</SectionTitle>
    <h2>
      I ENGINEER DETAIL-RICH USER INTERFACES TO SHIP MEANINGFUL SOLUTIONS THAT
      ARE <span class="highlight-y">EASY TO USE & ENJOYABLE</span>.
    </h2>
    <p>
      My work bridges design and engineering — translating complex requirements
      into user-centric, visually polished and accessible experiences. I
      collaborate closely with designers to ensure every interaction and
      component is thoughtfully crafted and seamless for the user.
    </p>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-l);
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  article h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-title);
    font-size: var(--font-step-3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-block: var(--space-m) var(--space-s);
  }

  .highlight-p {
    color: var(--color-p100);
  }

  .highlight-y {
    color: var(--color-y100);
  }
</style>
